---
diagram_type: architecture
title: Campus Library reporting pipeline
---
Database "Circulation source" as source [type: 'postgres']
Queue "Loan events" as events
Pipeline "Nightly rollup" as rollup [color: #507C60, style: dashed]
Storage "Archived snapshots" as archive
Database "Reporting mart" as mart [type: 'postgres']
Server "Dashboard service" as dashboard [icon: 'library-mark.svg']
Server "Monitoring service" as monitor

Note schedule {
  'The rollup publishes totals at 02:00 each night.'
}

Group "Data stores" as stores [label: bottom, stacked] {
  archive
  mart
}

Group "Reporting environment" as reporting {
  events
  rollup
  stores
  schedule
  dashboard
}

Link: source > events [proto: CDC]
Link: events > rollup [proto: AMQP, style: dashed]
Link: archive < rollup
Link: rollup > mart
Link: dashboard <> mart [proto: SQL]
Link: monitor - reporting
